    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Problem\n\n`v:startreason` has three possible values: \"normal\", \"restart\", and \"restart!\". Asymmetrically, `v:exitreason`, despite being `v:startreason`'s mirror, combines both `:restart` and `:restart!` under \"restart\".\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n`v:exitreason` can be either \"restart\" or \"restart!\", depending on whether `:restart` was used with a bang or not.",
